B.bpM=new A.a5("Children","Yora is for businesses and is not meant for anyone under 18.")
B.bpN=new A.a5("Who can use Yora","Yora is for food businesses. The person who registers must be the owner or be allowed to act for the Food Place, and must be 18 or older. Only the owner and the staff the owner adds should use it.")
B.bpQ=new A.a5("Suspension and closing","We may suspend an account for misuse, illegal use, security risk or (once plans start) non-payment, after notice where possible. You can stop using Yora and delete your account anytime: Settings \u203a Delete my account.")
B.bpS=new A.a5("Payments from your customers","Yora does not collect money. Your customers pay you directly (cash, UPI, card). Yora only records it and shows your own UPI QR. We are not a bank or payment company and are not part of any payment dispute.")
B.bpT=new A.a5("Security","PINs are hashed, connections are encrypted, and access is limited by role. No system is 100% secure; keep your PIN secret and switch off staff who leave. If a data breach happens we will act quickly and inform the people affected and the authorities as the law requires.")
B.bpZ=new A.a5("Data on the phone","\u2022 The login session, language, theme colour and printer choice are kept on the phone.\n\u2022 For offline billing, the menu, tables and bill settings are saved on the phone, and bills made without internet stay on that phone until they upload. Do not clear the app data or uninstall the app while bills are waiting to upload.\n\u2022 Fingerprint login is checked by Android itself. Your fingerprint never leaves the phone and we never receive it.")
B.bq2=new A.a5("Phone permissions","\u2022 Internet: to save and sync data.\n\u2022 Fingerprint (optional): quick login.\n\u2022 Bluetooth / Nearby devices (optional): to print on a Bluetooth printer.")
B.bq3=new A.a5("What we do NOT collect","\u2022 We do not take, hold or process any money. Customers pay the Food Place directly by cash, UPI or card; Yora only records it. We never ask for card numbers, UPI PIN, OTP or bank passwords.\n\u2022 No location, contacts, photos, microphone or camera access.\n\u2022 No advertising, no ad tracking and we do not sell or rent any data.")
B.bq6=new A.a5("Law","This policy follows the laws of India, including the Information Technology Act, 2000 and the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 as it comes into force.")
B.bq7=new A.a5("Price and subscription","Yora is free during testing. If paid plans start, the price, plan period (monthly / yearly), any free trial and what happens on renewal will be shown in the app before you pay. Payments in the Android app will be made through Google Play, and you can cancel any time in the Play Store (Subscriptions). Refunds will follow the refund policy published then and Google Play's rules.")
B.bqa=new A.a5("Your responsibility for bills and taxes","\u2022 You set prices, taxes (GST etc.), charges, discounts, GSTIN and FSSAI details. Check they are correct before giving bills.\n\u2022 You are responsible for your business licences, GST registration and returns, and accounts.\n\u2022 Reports are a help. Please check figures with your CA before filing any return. Yora is not tax or legal advice.")
B.bqb=new A.a5("Why the data is used","Only to run Yora for the Food Place: log in staff, take orders, print KOTs and bills, make reports and Excel files, keep the activity log, protect accounts from misuse, give support, and follow the law.")
B.bqd=new A.a5(B.aB,0)
B.bqj=new A.a5("Service","We try to keep Yora running at all times, but there may be breaks for maintenance, internet or cloud problems. We may improve, change or remove features. Important changes will be informed in the app.")
B.qv=new A.Oe(0,"left")
B.qw=new A.Oe(1,"right")
B.bqp=new A.a5(B.qv,B.qw)
B.bqr=new A.a5(B.ln,B.lo)
B.bqt=new A.a5(B.lo,B.ln)
B.bqu=new A.a5(!1,!1)
