B.bqw=new A.a5(!1,!0)
B.bqx=new A.a5(B.lk,B.ll)
B.bqy=new A.a5("Sharing","We share data only with our cloud provider (Supabase) to run the service, or when the law requires it. Data leaves Yora when you choose to share it: printing, sharing a PDF / Excel file or sending a bill on WhatsApp.")
B.bqB=new A.a5("Changes to this policy","If this policy changes, the new version and date will be shown in the app and on our website.")
B.bqC=new A.a5("Offline billing","When the internet is down, Yora can make bills on the phone and upload them when the internet returns. Bills waiting on the phone can be lost if the phone is lost, broken, reset or the app is uninstalled before upload.")
B.bqI=new A.a5(B.ll,B.lk)
B.bqJ=new A.a5("Your data","Your menu, bills, reports and other business data belong to you. You can download them anytime as PDF / Excel.")
B.bqK=new A.a5("Changes to these terms","We may update these terms. The date at the top will change and important changes will be shown in the app. Using Yora after that means you accept the new terms.")
B.bqM=new A.a5("Your rights","\u2022 See and download your data: Reports \u203a PDF / Excel.\n\u2022 Correct data: edit it in the app, or ask the owner.\n\u2022 Delete data: Settings \u203a Delete my account, or email us.\n\u2022 Complain: write to the Grievance Officer below.")
B.bqP=new A.a5("How long data is kept","\u2022 While the account is active, so bills and reports stay available for accounts and taxes.\n\u2022 Owner deletes the account: the Food Place and all its data are deleted from the database at once. Copies in the cloud provider's automatic backups are removed in its normal backup cycle.\n\u2022 Staff deletes the account: the login and mobile number are deleted. The staff name stays on bills and records made by that person, because the Food Place must keep its business records.")
B.bqQ=new A.a5("Data stored in Yora","\u2022 Food Place details entered by the owner: name, address, phone, GSTIN, FSSAI number, UPI ID, bill settings, taxes, charges and offers.\n\u2022 Owner and staff: name, mobile number and role. The 6-digit PIN is stored only in hashed (scrambled) form; we cannot see it.\n\u2022 Business records: menu, tables, orders, kitchen tickets (KOT), bills, payment mode and amount recorded, discounts and their reasons, expenses, stock, day closing and an activity log of staff actions.\n\u2022 A customer's name and mobile number, only if staff type them on a bill.")
B.bqR=new A.a5(!0,!1)
B.bqS=new A.a5(!0,!0)
B.bqT=new A.a5("Not allowed","Using Yora for anything illegal, fake bills, entering other people's data without a right to, trying to access another Food Place's data, or harming the service.")
B.bqU=new A.a5(B.qw,B.qv)
B.bqY=new A.a5("Accounts and PINs","\u2022 Keep PINs secret. The owner is responsible for what staff do with their logins.\n\u2022 Switch off or delete staff who leave.\n\u2022 Tell us at once if you think an account is misused.")
B.bqZ=new A.a5("Who is responsible for which data","\u2022 The Food Place owner decides what business and customer data to enter and why. For that data the Food Place is responsible, and we store and process it only on the Food Place's behalf.\n\u2022 For owner and staff login details we are responsible.")
B.br0=new A.a5("Limitation of liability",'Yora is provided "as is". As far as the law allows, we are not liable for indirect losses or business loss caused by wrong entries, internet, phone or printer problems. This does not remove any right you have by law.')
